<p>Make the impure blood of all creatures around you in radius 10 boil.</p><p>Each enemy afflicted by a disease, poison, or wound will have one removed at random dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> blight damage, healing you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">52, 70, 85, 97, 107,</acronym> and slowing them by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 44%, 53%, 59%, 64%</acronym> for 5 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>